<p data-start="2315" data-end="2380">Playful critique of technological and philosophical conventions</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2383" data-end="2442">
<p data-start="2385" data-end="2442">Projects like TYPHA, Spherepop, Neanderthal Lithophones</p>
</li>
