<hr data-start="321" data-end="324">
<h3 data-start="326" data-end="342">Key Insights</h3>
<ol data-start="344" data-end="2103">
<li data-start="344" data-end="715">
<p data-start="347" data-end="406"><strong data-start="347" data-end="386">Entropic Coupling as Universal Law:</strong><br data-start="386" data-end="389">
The equation</p>
